WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.134 --> 00:00:12.183
Cora swam behind a large glass bottle.

2
00:00:12.184 --> 00:00:15.909
"You look huge!" Rita said.

3
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.736
"Good!" Cora said.

4
00:00:18.737 --> 00:00:26.878
"Bring those scorpionfish here!"

5
00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:30.578
Rita swam toward the scorpionfish.

6
00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:37.933
"Big news!" she said. "I saw a little octopus!"

7
00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:43.645
"Yum!" one scorpionfish said. "Where?"

8
00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:48.573
"Follow me!" Rita darted away.

9
00:00:48.574 --> 00:00:53.733
The scorpionfish followed Rita back to Cora.

10
00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:56.894
Cora waved her tentacles.

11
00:00:56.895 --> 00:01:04.052
"Yikes!" a fish cried. "That octopus is huge!"

12
00:01:04.053 --> 00:01:07.701
"Where's Mo?" Cora shouted.

13
00:01:07.702 --> 00:01:12.330
The scorpionfish looked scared. "Huh?"

14
00:01:12.331 --> 00:01:15.250
Cora waved her tentacles again.

15
00:01:15.251 --> 00:01:19.637
"The lionfish said you chased our friend!"

16
00:01:19.638 --> 00:01:26.216
A scorpionfish frowned. "That lionfish always tells lies!

17
00:01:26.217 --> 00:01:30.025
He's the one who chased your friend."

18
00:01:30.026 --> 00:01:32.860
"What?" Cora said.

19
00:01:32.861 --> 00:01:45.822
All the scorpionfish looked mad. "Let's go!"

20
00:01:45.823 --> 00:01:55.389
Everyone raced to the lionfish's cave.

21
00:01:55.390 --> 00:02:00.170
"There's Mo!" Cora cried.

22
00:02:00.171 --> 00:02:03.503
The big fish surrounded the lionfish.

23
00:02:03.504 --> 00:02:06.027
"Let Mo go!"

24
00:02:06.028 --> 00:02:12.182
"No!" the lionfish cried. "He's my dinner."

25
00:02:12.183 --> 00:02:15.714
The big scorpionfish pointed their spikes.

26
00:02:15.715 --> 00:02:22.732
"Okay!" the lionfish cried. "I'll let him go."

27
00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:26.778
"Cora!" Mo swam to her.

28
00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:30.126
"What a surprise—you found me!"

29
00:02:30.127 --> 00:02:33.052
"Follow us," Cora said.

30
00:02:33.053 --> 00:02:43.891
"We have another surprise for you!"

